dropped the body
--
N5008 [temp.deduct.call]/3, [expr.type]/1: for a forwarding reference T &&,
an lvalue argument of type A deduces A &, any other argument A.  The
xvalue static_cast<char &&>(c) has type char ([expr.type]/1: the reference
is adjusted away); the front end types it char && and deduced T = char &&
(bin53).  Also for a pack of forwarding references.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18
accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
